{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten-year-old Margo exists in the shadow of her vibrant older sister, Janice, a shadow cast by parents who are too busy admiring one child to truly see the other, leaving Margo to navigate a world of quiet yearning and internal suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Quiet Hum of a Lonely Heart is a short kinetic novel that features ~5K words and 34 images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features themes such as:\u00a0Loneliness and isolation within a family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sibling rivalry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-worth and identity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nature of parental love and unintentional neglect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding one's voice and inner strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of imagination and quiet observation</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934520?t=1754591093","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934520/e1073aae1d3c7437352efcae1db71c4adb8c2102/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754591093","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934520/b95d377a3aad5592e1fab523ff376ea42c774861/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754591093","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934520/b95d377a3aad5592e1fab523ff376ea42c774861/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754591093","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten-year-old Margo exists in the shadow of her vibrant o